  "When active, player forward movement slows down by 0.5 for 4 seconds": "激活后，玩家向前移动速度会减慢 0.5，持续 4 秒",
  "When active, this effect doubles all resources except Boss crown": "激活时，此效果会使除 Boss 皇冠之外的所有资源翻倍",
  "While active, spawns a shuriken that deals normal arrow base damage, doubled against bleeding enemies": "激活时，会生成一把手里剑，对流血的敌人造成正常箭的基础伤害，伤害加倍",
  "YOUR FINAL CHOICE": "您的最终选择",
  "You melt the crowns into tools and unbolt the engine. Its last breath rolls across a world that has forgotten silence.\n\nThere is no throne now. No next carriage, no final boss, no promise that the road ahead will be kind. You step off the tracks, and the others follow.\n\nFor the first time, nobody knows where the journey ends.": "您将表冠熔化成工具并松开发动机的螺栓。它的最后一口气席卷了一个忘记了寂静的世界。\n\n现在已经没有王位了。没有下一辆车，没有最终的boss，没有前方的路会是美好的承诺。你走下轨道，其他人也跟着走。\n\n第一次，没有人知道旅程的终点​​在哪里。",
  "You throw the final switch and bring the railway home. The carriages become houses; the engine warms gardens instead of feeding fire.\n\nYou hang the four crowns above a ticket window that will never charge a fare. Everyone gets a key. For once, staying is a choice.\n\nTomorrow, you will help build the platform.": "你拉动最后一个道岔，把铁路带回家。马车变成了房屋；发动机可以温暖花园而不是助长火势。\n\n你把四个皇冠挂在永远不收费的售票窗口上方。每个人都有一把钥匙。这一次，留下来是一种选择。\n\n明天，你将帮助搭建这个平台。",
  "Your loot is banked. Spend it in Upgrades and come back stronger.": "你的战利品已存入银行。将其用于升级并变得更强。",
