  "UPGRADE_HIDE_RANKS": "UPGRADE_HIDE_RANKS",
  "You defeated the first railway boss! Thanks for playing Railway Fury.\n\nThe full game continues across three more levels with new scenery, stronger enemies, fire-control upgrades and two endings.\n\nReplay Level 1 or return to Upgrades.": "你打败了第一个铁路老大！感谢您玩Railway Fury。\n\n完整的游戏将继续跨越三个关卡，包括新的场景、更强大的敌人、火力控制升级和两个结局。\n\n重玩级别 1 或返回升级。",
  "[b]RAILWAY FURY[/b]\n\n[b]Artwork[/b]\nClassic artwork: Hermurx\nModern characters and weapons: Synty Studios\n\n[b]Music[/b]\nPhat Phrog Studio — fantasy, medieval and Dark Abyss collections\nClassic soundtrack: Loyalty Freak Music and Komiku\n\n[b]Sound Effects[/b]\nGame Assets collection and Sonniss libraries\nConcrete footsteps: Levan Nadashvili / Sonniss GDC 2016\n\nThank you for playing Railway Fury.": "[b]RAILWAY FURY[/b]\n\n[b]艺术品[/b]\n经典艺术作品：赫莫克斯\n现代角色和武器：Synty Studios\n\n[b]音乐[/b]\nPhat Phrog Studio — 奇幻、中世纪和黑暗深渊系列\n经典配乐：Loyalty Freak Music 和 Komiku\n\n[b]音效[/b]\n游戏资产集合和 Sonniss 库\n具体的脚步：Levan Nadashvili / Sonniss GDC 2016\n\n感谢您玩Railway Fury。",
